    "description": "Shoo Loong Kan Hot Pot Manhattan offers authentic Sichuan-style Chinese hotpot in the heart of Union Square, New York City. Located at 22 E 13th St, NYC, we serve rich spicy broths, classic Chongqing flavors, freshly sliced meats, seafood, vegetables, and a full self-serve sauce bar. Founded in Chengdu, China, Shoo Loong Kan has grown to over 800 hotpot restaurants worldwide, known for premium ingredients, traditional recipes, and elegant dining. Perfect for group hotpot, family meals, or late-night dining in Manhattan, we welcome locals and visitors seeking the best hotpot in NYC. Dine in, reserve online, or walk in today for an unforgettable Union Square hotpot experience.",
